# WHOOP application credentials, read by `mcp-whoop login`. Register your own
# application in the WHOOP Developer Dashboard
# (https://developer-dashboard.whoop.com) and copy these from its settings.
# Serving needs none of them: the stored login carries everything a refresh
# requires.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and load it natively with
# `node --env-file=.env dist/index.js login` — no dotenv involved.
WHOOP_CLIENT_ID=
WHOOP_CLIENT_SECRET=
WHOOP_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8788/callback

# Ask for less than every read scope at login, comma- or space-separated.
#WHOOP_SCOPES=read:profile,read:sleep

# Keep the token file in this directory instead of the platform's per-user
# data area.
#WHOOP_TOKEN_STORE=

# For tests and local development only.
#WHOOP_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
#WHOOP_API_BASE_URL=https://api.prod.whoop.com
